> XX==.|L_a_XX==0)){
679.         di as error ""
680.         di as error "No treatment effect can be estimated. This is because Design Restriction 1 in de Chaisemartin & D'Haultfoeuille (2
> 024) is not satisfied in the data, given the options requested. This may be due to the fact that groups' period-one treatment is continuou
> s, or takes a large number of values, and you have not specified the continuous option. If so, you can try to specify this option. If the 
> issue persists even with this option, this means that all groups experience their first treatment change at the same date, a situation whe
> re the estimators of de Chaisemartin & D'Haultfoeuille (2024) cannot be used."
681.         di as input _continue ""
682.                 
.         exit
683. }
