> `by') predict_het(`predict_het') ci_level(`ci_level') design(`design') date_first_switch(`date_first_switch') continuous(`continuous') `le
> ss_conservative_se' `normalized_weights'
2687. notes : "{bf:{ul:Date of Run:}} `c(current_date)' at `c(current_time)'"
